From: User-3090 <71881005+User-3090@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 06:47:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(windows): unify remote attach and image transport

Share remote attach orchestration across platforms, enable the Windows SSH bridge with bounded named-pipe handshakes, and transport clipboard or dropped images through the existing client protocol. Keep package-manager detection and automatic remote installation Unix-specific; Windows remote hosts resolve herdr.exe from the SSH user's PATH.
